DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
       The  aacccctt()  system  call  enables  or disables process accounting.  If
       called with the pathname of an existing file as its argument,  account‐
       ing is turned on, and records for each terminating process are appended
       to the file as it terminates.  An argument of NULL causes accounting to
       be turned off.

